  5.833290  0.000000  0.000000
  2.916645  3.833642  0.000000
  0.000000  0.000000  28.346456
ATOMIC_POSITIONS {crystal}
  C  0.000112  -0.000141  0.000000
  C  0.333221  0.333474  0.000000
K_POINTS {automatic}
